A file deletion and a file creation, each followed by a blank line that
sits outside its hunk. A side that starts at 0 must be empty, so those
blanks are not ambiguous here even after the counts are scrambled.

diff --git a/a-gone.txt b/a-gone.txt
deleted file mode 100644
index 4cb29ea..0000000
--- a/a-gone.txt
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,3 +0,0 @@
-one
-two
-three

diff --git a/m-kept.txt b/m-kept.txt
index 7a28df3..3cc64f7 100644
--- a/m-kept.txt
+++ b/m-kept.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 alpha
-beta
+BETA
 gamma
 delta
diff --git a/z-new.yaml b/z-new.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..636c050
--- /dev/null
+++ b/z-new.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    A release note.

